# 15.⁠ ⁠Hospital Consultation Priority
# Accept a patient's temperature and oxygen saturation.
# If oxygen saturation is below 90%, classify as high priority. Otherwise,
# check whether the temperature is at least 39°C. If so, classify as urgent; otherwise, classify as normal priority.
# (Simplified programming exercise, not a medical triage tool.)

